Confirmed:
- `frontendDist: ../ui/dist` — vite builds to `ui/dist` (root: ui, default outDir = dist)
- vite has NO rollupOptions.input with curtain.html → dist only has index.html → **curtain.html missing in production**. That's the root cause of the curtain never appearing.

Fix vite.config.ts:
```ts
import { defineConfig } from "vite";
import { resolve } from "path";

export default defineConfig({
  root: "ui",
  clearScreen: false,
  server: { port: 1420, strictPort: true },
  build: {
    target: "es2022",
    minify: "esbuild",
    sourcemap: false,
    rollupOptions: {
      input: {
        main: resolve(__dirname, "ui/index.html"),
        curtain: resolve(__dirname, "ui/curtain.html"),
      },
    },
  },
});
```

Then dist will contain curtain.html + its assets.

Now — the user's design request for the curtain/menu: "yep yeni bi menü tasarla — sanki YIKIM launcher menüsü yeniden açıldı ve geri kapandı. Eski klasörü (YIKIM Client) incele, launcher'ine bak."

